.TH CHM-AD 1
.SH NAME
chm-ad - Chimera II Active Directory integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-ad
status | config | configure | join | leave | test | users | groups
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stages Kerberos, NSS and PAM configuration for SSSD or Samba/winbind and performs explicit interactive domain joins when supported provider tools are installed. Credentials are never accepted as command-line passwords.
